<title>USA: Gloucester, Mass., won by Fleet Securities.</title>
<headline>Gloucester, Mass., won by Fleet Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities Inc. said it won $14.575 million of Gloucester, Mass., general obligation school project loan act of 1948 limited tax bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.9508 percent.</p>
</text>
